s if the real table had 82... unless the real table didn't. You know what — let me look up the actual 2023 Série A table facts I'm SURE about:\n1. Palmeiras champion (100% sure)\n2. Santos relegated 17th? (100% sure relegated; finished 17th? they were 17th I think with 43 pts)\n3. Botafogo 5th 64 pts (now verified by data ✓)\n\nIf Santos is relegated in reality, and my computed bottom-4 was [vasco, goias, coritiba, america] — Santos should be in there! Let me print the full bottom of the computed 2023 table. Santos' computed record from the matches I printed: last 6: L? W(0-1 away Goiás = Santos WIN), D, D, L, L, L. Let me just print the full table.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05d40f361001QxVYDwc7C3fC4J","sessionID":"ses_fa2db0ef4ffeemTLK4uNaaAd5c","messageID":"msg_05d405faf001pP0pfKvwDJ1e75"}}
