 of L. If they differ, the DATA has inconsistent scores (some rows wrong).\n\nFrom the table: W sum: 21+19+19+19+18+17+14+15+15+15+14+13+11+11+12+11+11+9+8+5 = let me not hand-sum; script it. And draws must be even (each draw counted twice): D sum = 5+10+9+9+10+10+14+10+9+9+10+12+15+14+8+10+9+12+6+9 = script it.\n\nIf total draws is ODD → data has a wrong row (one team's draw recorded as...). D sum must be even. Let me check.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05d4737a3001huraFRSJ1NqfqA","sessionID":"ses_fa2db0ef4ffeemTLK4uNaaAd5c","messageID":"msg_05d40f8b3001RefBwrYRCISi75"}}
