mpion\" is wrong. Label champion only when venue is None. Relegation only when venue None too. Fix.\n\nAlso in `_compute_table` with venue filter — the StandingRow.matches counts only venue matches ✓.\n\nLet me apply these tweaks.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05d4b9417001nHfGYWUU0l8awA","sessionID":"ses_fa2db0ef4ffeemTLK4uNaaAd5c","messageID":"msg_05d4b32d7001wrSHm6XcZGeh0Q"}}
