ulo)\"\n- \"Derby Paulista (Palmeiras x Corinthians)\"\n- \"Majestoso (Corinthians x São Paulo)\"\n- \"Clássico Mineiro (Atlético x Cruzeiro)\"\n- \"Ba-Vi (Bahia x Vitória)\"\n- \"Atletiba (Athletico x Coritiba)\"\n\nSo test keys: \"Fla-Flu\", \"Gre-Nal (Grêmio x Internacional)\", \"Choque-Rei (Palmeiras x São Paulo)\". Fix the test. Also earlier printed output showed ('Fla-Flu', 4) ✓ consistent.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05d50291e001rjx8Ub7uHUD0gd","sessionID":"ses_fa2db0ef4ffeemTLK4uNaaAd5c","messageID":"msg_05d4feb13001XBicAuCEMZUP8X"}}
